                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I like Age of Wonders games but this is my favorite.  I like the art style, the sound and music and the layers of gameplay.  Research and item upgrades matter a lot in this game and there is a great deal to manage but it keeps from overwhelming you.  Factions are creative and different enough from stock high fantasy units in the other games (save for a very \"dwarven\" faction).  If you like science fiction and 4x gameplay this game will delight you while scratching that \"one more turn\" itch!",
